        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;fontSize=13;" value="REQUEST FLOW (solid arrows)&#xa;Client / User → Client Interface → Load Balancer → Application Server → Course Service → Database&#xa;Application Server → Video / Object Storage&#xa;&#xa;RESPONSE FLOW (dashed arrows)&#xa;Database → Course Service; Video / Object Storage → Application Server. The application server returns the result through the Load Balancer and Client Interface to the user.&#xa;&#xa;Example: A student selects a lecture. The request passes through the frontend and backend, the service checks enrollment in the database, and the video is retrieved from object storage." vertex="1">
